          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "R9–R12 | 0 Ω (jumpers) | Select which M5Stack bus pin (pin 19/21 for ch.1, pin 20/22 for ch.2) supplies PWM1/PWM2"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Following the note literally can leave PWM2 disconnected from the Core2/CoreS3 bus pin, preventing control of the second PWM servo.",
      "confidence": 0.84
